cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ATLASIS, please cite it using this metadata."
title: ATLASIS
abstract: >-
  An open hospital-siting and accessibility engine: joint maximal-coverage
  location (MCLP) selection of new facilities, an enhanced two-step floating
  catchment area (E2SFCA) index, and uncertainty reporting, computed along
  real road-network drive times from OpenStreetMap and WorldPop data.
authors:
  - alias: bashfullad78
    family-names: Zafar
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bashfullad78/Atlasis"
keywords:
  - healthcare accessibility
  - maximal covering location problem
  - E2SFCA
  - OpenStreetMap
  - WorldPop
  - GIS
  - universal health coverage
